decision_flow:
flowchart TD
  A{Is the symptom a config or tool failure?} -->|Yes| B[Run claude doctor and /status]
  A -->|No| C{Is the symptom a cost or latency rise?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Read /usage and telemetry first]
  C -->|No| E{Must the last edits be undone?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Use rewind for tracked edits]
  E -->|No| G[Check prompt or model change first]
  F --> H{Did a Bash command change the file?}
  H -->|Yes| I[Use version control]
